Goal
- Rebuild every production module against the current real-MIDI architecture and canonical control library.
- Reuse established software patterns and implementations wherever applicable: state shape, MIDI/event flow, timing/scheduling, lifecycle handling, persistence, editor/runtime separation, and canonical control behavior.
